        "\n",
        "### ⚠️ Two things you must not get wrong\n",
        "\n",
        "**`log2_tpm` is already on a log2 scale** — it is `log2(TPM + 0.001)`.\n",
        "Do **not** apply `np.log2` to it. Because it is already logged, a \"fold\n",
        "change\" here is a **difference** of medians, not a ratio.\n",
        "\n",
        "**`tp53_status` is blank for some tumours.** Not every patient had their\n",
        "DNA sequenced. Those are *unknown*, not wild-type — treat them as\n",
        "wild-type and you quietly dilute your own result. Drop them."
